      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The development of disease in left internal mammary artery bypass grafts is uncommon. Furthermore, development of restenosis following successful angioplasty is very low. We report a patient with in-stent restenosis of left internal mammary graft treated successfully by balloon dilatation."},
